# Cloudflare Pages の応答ヘッダー（安全のための設定）
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://api.github.com; img-src 'self' data:; style-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action https://github.com
